1
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,297
What is that?!

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:07,537
Weren't Avdol's flames supposed
to be able to sense anything?!

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,140
Avdol, where are you?!

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,230
Avdol...

5
00:00:12,313 --> 00:00:14,580
has been reduced to nothingness.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:19,020
You were arrogant enough to
believe you could defeat Lord Dio.

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,780
Allow me to demonstrate
just how wrong you were.

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,960
You will fall in line, one by one,

9
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:34,780
as I scatter your atomic fragments
across the recesses of the Void.

10
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,660
It can't be!

11
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,320
I don't believe you!

12
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,060
Avdol's not dead!

13
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,540
Don't you lie to me!

14
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,330
What?

15
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:57,457
I never would have
imagined Polareth's stand

16
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:59,817
could attack this
swiftly from so far away.

17
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,720
An amazing feat to be sure.

18
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,240
Over here!

19
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,932
I want you to look at me when I kill you!

20
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,497
I'll see you

21
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:42,580
next

22
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:48,870
time.

23
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:55,360
It's coming to the end of the battle.

24
00:01:56,860 --> 00:02:00,017
I'm going to hit the video of the world!

25
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:02,740
Stop it now!

26
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,397
It's the beginning of the story.

27
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,557
I'm going to take the moment.

28
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:11,917
I'm going to continue to go.

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,900
I'm going to continue to go. Crusaders.

30
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:21,557
The last page of the last page.

31
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:26,260
And please land on the end of the war.

32
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,577
July Lloyd.

33
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:36,660
July Lloyd.

34
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:40,860
Else version.

35
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:52,400
All right, now I'm sure
something fishy's going on.

36
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:55,877
Ever since we escaped the Mirage,
I've heard the sounds of a battle.

37
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,790
Blast it!

38
00:02:56,873 --> 00:02:58,701
Avdol and Polareff are out there.

39
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,400
Damn that guy!

40
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:07,517
I know I hit the bastard, but
it wasn't enough to kill him.

41
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:10,777
He just swallowed himself again
so he could hide in that abyss.

42
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:12,600
Damn that guy in his stand!

43
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:23,460
Avdol, how could you do that?

44
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:26,640
How could you break the
one rule you gave us?

45
00:03:27,140 --> 00:03:30,081
Bulldoreff, Iggy, you have
to get out of here now!

46
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:32,980
You told us we had to watch our own backs!

47
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:36,279
That you wouldn't save us
even if we were in danger!

48
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,800
You liar!

49
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:42,317
You've been meddling in
other people's business

50
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:45,040
ever since the moment
we set foot in India!

51
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,940
Dammit, Avdol!

52
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:51,533
Why couldn't you just leave me alone
and mind your own freaking business?!

53
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:56,900
If I hadn't ducked, I'd
be a dead man right now!

54
00:03:57,800 --> 00:04:00,240
It's like fate is telling me to carry on!

55
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:03,854
This must be Avdol's way of
knocking some sense into me!

56
00:04:18,220 --> 00:04:20,044
It's way too dangerous in here.

57
00:04:20,780 --> 00:04:21,780
Let's get moving!

58
00:04:31,740 --> 00:04:32,760
Come on, Iggy!

59
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,517
We have to make it upstairs!

60
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,820
Don't fall behind!

61
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:46,540
Look up ahead! It's the exit!

62
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,878
We're almost there!

63
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:52,380
But I won't just turn tail and run away!

64
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:57,837
Avdol sacrificed himself for us, and
I'll repay that debt no matter what!

65
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:01,817
He believed we had the power to
put an end to Dio once and for all!

66
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:04,637
I can't betray his faith
in us by letting him down!

67
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,014
That is not an option!

68
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:11,680
I refuse to take the easy way
out like some common coward!

69
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:14,877
I'm gonna see this fight
through to the bitter end!

70
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:18,000
The only place I'm running
to is Dio's Shadow Den!

71
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,820
So up the stairs we go!

72
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:39,100
I expected him to dash out the door.

73
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,670
Pity.

74
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,510
Impressive.

75
00:05:44,740 --> 00:05:46,100
He managed a hit.

76
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:49,637
It seems Polnareff's mental
fortitude gives him the

77
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:53,191
ability to conquer his fears
in the face of imminent death.

78
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:56,640
You will soon be joining
Avdol, rest assured.

79
00:05:57,160 --> 00:06:01,689
Your strength pales in comparison to
the harbinger of death that is my stand.

80
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:08,061
If what he says is true, his stand's jaws
are the gateway to an alternate dimension.

81
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:10,160
A dark, unimaginable abyss.

82
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:15,222
One that allows him to move through our
realm without leaving any trace of himself.

83
00:06:16,820 --> 00:06:18,540
But how does he do it?

84
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:22,169
And how the heck am I
supposed to beat him?

85
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,220
Oh, no, no!

86
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,460
He's cut us off!

87
00:06:33,340 --> 00:06:34,170
He's nearby!

88
00:06:34,780 --> 00:06:35,940
But where exactly?

89
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:38,520
Iggy, I need you to watch my back.

90
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:42,311
And don't worry, I'll do the same for you.

91
00:06:58,900 --> 00:06:59,730
Okay,

92
00:06:59,813 --> 00:07:03,457
if he wants to reach us, then he's going
to have to come out of that other realm.

93
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:04,420
This is good.

94
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,577
He has to come out from the
dark beyond at some point.

95
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:12,013
When he does, I'll take my chance and
attack him with everything I've got.

96
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:14,691
Alright, come at me, you demented pinball!

97
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,340
I'll slice you in two!

98
00:07:16,620 --> 00:07:19,267
Now I pissed off so my
chariot's even faster!

99
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:24,420
I may have lost Avdol, but it'll be a cool
day in hell before I let you get away!

100
00:07:37,620 --> 00:07:38,860
What the hell?

101
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,920
He was hiding under my foot!

102
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:42,560
Carry up!

103
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:53,100
My foot!

104
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,660
Now you can't run away.

105
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:59,800
I got your foot so that
you can't hide anymore.

106
00:08:04,100 --> 00:08:05,300
Eat silver!

107
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:07,040
I'll pass.

108
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,750
Mr.

109
00:08:21,833 --> 00:08:23,387
Joestar, a brawl's underway.

110
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,837
Avdol and Polnareff.

111
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:28,437
Sounds like they came in after us and
wound up getting themselves into a fight.

112
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,520
Come on, you two!

113
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:31,400
We have to find them ASAP!

114
00:08:37,180 --> 00:08:40,260
You've managed to hide
amid the chaos, Polnareff.

115
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,840
How futile.

116
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:45,637
You couldn't have gone
far with that injury.

117
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,367
Which means you're hiding
beneath the rubble.

118
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:56,277
By now you must have realized
you're helpless against me.

119
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:58,419
You shall meet your end by my hand.

120
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:02,880
Now then, where could you be, Polnareff?

121
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:05,320
That's quite the ruckus, Cool Ice.

122
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,720
Lord Dio!

123
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,397
Please be careful, my lord.

124
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:20,597
I believe Polnareff and that four-legged
Rudin are still hiding nearby.

125
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,660
Allow me to handle the situation.

126
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:26,274
You mustn't trouble yourself
with such nonsense, Master.

127
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:40,760
A fake deal made from the fool.

128
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:42,000
We got him.

129
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:47,518
You'd think I'd feel guilty about
attacking from behind like a coward.

130
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,037
And you'd be wrong.

131
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:51,677
Because you pulled the same shit on Avdol.

132
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,617
This is the death you deserve!

133
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:56,140
Now, Iggy, crucify him!

134
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:08,480
Now, Iggy, crucify him!

135
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:13,257
Make him pay for what he did End his life
in the same merciless way he did Avdol's.

136
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:14,980
Send him straight to hell!

137
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:23,140
You're kidding! He knows!

138
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:24,280
But how?

139
00:10:25,060 --> 00:10:29,119
Because the windows to my left are
letting in the light from the sun.

140
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:32,779
Lord Dio would never enter
this room during the day.

141
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:36,541
He'll suffer a thousand
deaths for your deception!

142
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:38,090
Iggy!

143
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:51,349
I made a vow to Lord Dio that
I would kill you, interlopers.

144
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:53,437
He entrusted me with that honor.

145
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,320
Lord Dio's a man of his word.

146
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:58,437
He would never descend to the
second floor for any reason.

147
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,400
No, he's gonna kill Iggy.

148
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:03,013
He's about to be swallowed by the abyss.

149
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:05,860
Now die, you filthy, pathetic dog.

150
00:11:06,980 --> 00:11:10,860
Your incorrigible ruse forced me
to destroy Lord Dio's likeness!

151
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,840
Did he really just hit him?

152
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,920
He didn't use the void.

153
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,944
Instead of killing Iggy,
he went in for a punch!

154
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:29,780
Do you know what you've done?

155
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,500
I don't care if it was a fake.

156
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:35,777
You forced me to destroy a
figure in the form of Lord Dio.

157
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:37,980
and you must answer for that crime.

158
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,240
Your life is mine now!

159
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:42,991
I will kick you to death!

160
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:49,957
My dark abyss could swallow
you whole in an instant,

161
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:52,569
but a quick death
wouldn't satiate my fury.

162
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:56,180
This whole mess, it's all your fault!

163
00:11:56,540 --> 00:11:59,069
This is what happens
to those who anger me!

164
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:01,177
Have you learned your lesson yet?

165
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:02,220
How about it?

166
00:12:02,420 --> 00:12:03,297
Is this better?

167
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,800
Stop it! Leave him alone!

168
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,715
It's like Cool Ice's brain has melted!

169
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:15,357
Is he really going batshit
because he destroyed

170
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:17,734
some pile of sand that looked like Dio?

171
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:21,400
From over here, his
soul is the murky abyss!

172
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:23,597
It's a bottomless black
hole that obliterates

173
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:26,033
any and everything that gets in its way!

174
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:30,277
I was warned about the humans!

175
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:34,595
Lord Days said the Resolve in their
hearts must never be underestimated.

176
00:12:34,860 --> 00:12:37,840
But you, you're just a flea-bitten stray.

177
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:42,160
You've never known Resolve, and you
certainly know nothing of pride.

178
00:12:46,180 --> 00:12:47,860
You can't grin at this!

179
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:49,300
Leave him alone!

180
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,180
You like that, do you?

181
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,000
What did I say?

182
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:55,440
Come on, your suffering's just begun!

183
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:58,336
Cool ice, you're dealing with me now!

184
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:05,020
I'm ending this, Polnareff.

185
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:12,990
Damn it!

186
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:15,620
He's gone!

187
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:18,280
But more importantly, Iggy!

188
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:21,217
Our plan to trick Cool Ice
may have fallen through,

189
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:23,557
but your sand might have just saved us.

190
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:26,993
Thanks to you, I think I found
a way to find the bastard.

191
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,329
Yeah, that's him, alright.

192
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,127
I can see him moving around.

193
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:43,305
Guess your stand power
is a double-edged sword.

194
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:48,300
When you move, your stand has no choice
but to absorb everything in your path.

195
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:52,840
So choke on a mouthful of this and
get over here, you piece of shit!

196
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:57,452
As soon as you come out from behind
your stand's putrid teeth to attack me,

197
00:13:58,060 --> 00:14:00,760
I'll turn the tables and finish you off!

198
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,340
Bullseye, yeah! Eat that!

199
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:06,777
Well, would you look at that.

200
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:08,742
I found your weakness, Cool Ice.

201
00:14:09,060 --> 00:14:12,157
Any attempt to pinpoint my
location leaves you vulnerable,

202
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,997
which is probably a tad
inconvenient since you can't

203
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:17,962
see me without emerging
from your dark dimension.

204
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:19,680
It's over!

205
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:23,200
Now suck on my sword and
burn in hell, field-a-put!

206
00:14:23,540 --> 00:14:25,060
Hurry up and die!

207
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:34,650
What?

208
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:36,460
How are you still alive?

209
00:14:36,780 --> 00:14:39,140
I skewered your throat and brainstem!

210
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,900
Would you die already?

211
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:45,682
No way you're getting out of it!

212
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:47,457
Hurry up and die!

213
00:14:47,540 --> 00:14:51,280
Stop making me repeat myself! Die! Die!

214
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:56,220
I cannot die.

215
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:59,362
My mission is far too
important to feel any pain.

216
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:01,680
I will not rest until I kill you.

217
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:05,797
I'll swallow Iggy, the Joestars,
and anyone else who gets in my way.

218
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:08,821
Only after your deaths
will I allow myself to die.

219
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,290
Bastard!

220
00:15:17,373 --> 00:15:18,440
There's a good boy.

221
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,177
You knew to withdraw your sword.

222
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:22,620
I also know that you're about to die!

223
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:27,480
This is the one.

224
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,820
The vile arm you used to stab me.

225
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:37,420
Knock it off!

226
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:39,520
Damn it!

227
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:43,020
I had no choice but to shove him away! No!

228
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:45,829
You're not going anywhere!

229
00:15:48,100 --> 00:15:49,157
Did I get him?

230
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,920
Where'd he go now?

231
00:15:53,740 --> 00:15:54,570
Shit!

232
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:55,700
He got my leg!

233
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,080
I can't move!

234
00:15:57,520 --> 00:16:00,049
But I can't think about
the pain right now!

235
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:04,060
I was so close, I almost
managed to land a killing blow.

236
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:05,600
But he got away!

237
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:09,300
This guy is different,
fueled by pure vengeance.

238
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:11,033
And he's not just nuts.

239
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:13,660
His devotion to Dio is all-consuming.

240
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:16,240
But I won't let him get the upper hand.

241
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:18,077
You said you couldn't die yet?

242
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:20,500
Well, I can't die until I kill you!

243
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,240
Okay, here he comes!

244
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,480
Take this!

245
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,900
Shit! It's no use!

246
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:31,777
His stand just obliterated
the tip of my sword!

247
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:34,317
Though it probably wouldn't
matter even if it were intact.

248
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:37,437
It's impossible to attack him
when he's hidden in the abyss.

249
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:40,873
If I so much as touch that
thing, it'll swallow me whole!

250
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:44,730
Great!

251
00:16:44,813 --> 00:16:47,051
Now he's absorbing the building at random!

252
00:16:50,300 --> 00:16:51,130
That's clever.

253
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:54,117
He knows full well I'll go
after him if he shows himself.

254
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:57,671
So he's blindly attacking to
prevent me from fighting back.

255
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:59,320
He's not messing around.

256
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,797
At this rate, he's going
to hit me for sure.

257
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:04,645
I should pull back Chariot
and think of a plan.

258
00:17:10,580 --> 00:17:12,420
Damn, this isn't good.

259
00:17:12,980 --> 00:17:15,457
He's not going to last long
if he keeps losing blood.

260
00:17:15,540 --> 00:17:20,128
From the state he's in, I'd say his
broken ribs must have punctured his lungs.

261
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:30,297
And just when I thought
this couldn't get any worse,

262
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:32,674
why the hell is he devouring the walls?

263
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:39,097
Wait a second, I'm starting
to think I was all wrong.

264
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:40,239
This isn't random.

265
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:43,285
It was all part of his
plan from the beginning.

266
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:45,617
He's been drawing circles around me,

267
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:48,700
and with every lap, he's
getting closer and closer!

268
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:53,457
The odds are stacked against
me, but I have to do something.

269
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:54,660
He's closing in!

270
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:57,399
He still doesn't know our location,

271
00:17:57,520 --> 00:18:01,497
but with that rolling ball of death
hurtling toward us, it doesn't matter!

272
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:03,698
He's got us right where he wants us!

273
00:18:04,180 --> 00:18:09,004
There's no way I'm going to be able to
dodge an attack from him with this bum leg!

274
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:12,566
I have got to try to
escape through the floor!

275
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:18,429
I don't have enough
time to tunnel through!

276
00:18:18,540 --> 00:18:20,400
He's coming straight for us!

277
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,960
Somehow I dodged it!

278
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:27,595
Not out of the woods!

279
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:30,997
He's closing in on me like a
needle on an old record player!

280
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:33,477
I only have about five
more rounds before he makes

281
00:18:33,560 --> 00:18:36,325
his way back here and
finishes me off for good!

282
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:41,320
So, the million dollar question is,
how do I dodge with this injured leg?

283
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:58,400
If I had it my way, I'd just pick
option two, but I can't count on that.

284
00:18:58,620 --> 00:19:01,317
They only entered the mansion
ten minutes before us.

285
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:03,677
As much as I'd love for
them to swoop in out of thin

286
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:06,877
air and save the day like
some American comic book hero,

287
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:09,297
wishful thinking's not
going to save me now.

288
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:12,537
There's no point hoping for
an out-of-the-blue rescue.

289
00:19:12,620 --> 00:19:16,855
For all I know, the others might be
in the middle of a fight themselves.

290
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:18,620
All right, then.

291
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:20,766
Option one's our only choice.

292
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:25,720
Okay, Chariot.

293
00:19:25,900 --> 00:19:29,371
I need you to pull me out of
the circle as fast as you can.

294
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,638
What are you doing?

295
00:19:35,860 --> 00:19:37,620
Pull me faster, Chariot!

296
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,980
It's no use!

297
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:47,680
What do you know?

298
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:50,254
The answer ended up being option three.

299
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:52,160
Life's a bitch!

300
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:58,580
Silver Chariot is a finesse-oriented
stand that fights with a saber.

301
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:01,757
It simply doesn't have the
power to pull my body weight,

302
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,487
especially when I'm injured.

303
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,500
I'm done for.

304
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:22,285
You're holding on by a thread.

305
00:20:22,520 --> 00:20:24,108
Stay down, you stupid mutt!

306
00:20:24,300 --> 00:20:27,217
If you keep moving or try
using your stance power,

307
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:31,006
your broken ribs will sink deeper
into your lungs and kill you!

308
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:39,085
Hey, you can drop the
tough guy act, you idiot!

309
00:20:39,180 --> 00:20:43,239
The only thing this will accomplish
is you dying right along with me!

310
00:20:47,560 --> 00:20:51,937
Just you wait I'm the one who's gonna
save you you have to live on to tell

311
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:56,477
Mr Joestar and the others about this
bastard you have to defeat him in my

312
00:20:56,560 --> 00:21:02,137
stead Avdol might have saved me but you
sure as hell better not if we all die

313
00:21:02,220 --> 00:21:03,737
here then what was the point of this

314
00:21:03,820 --> 00:21:10,000
one more loop and it's lights It's out.

315
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:12,040
So it's number three.

316
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:14,580
Life can be a bitch sometimes.

317
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:17,660
We both wanted to win.

318
00:21:18,060 --> 00:21:19,840
Guess he wanted it more.

319
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:26,820
Au River, Iggy.

320
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:48,020
Thank you.

321
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:24,997
The blood that stings my
body is Avdol's handiwork.

322
00:23:25,080 --> 00:23:27,057
I'm not privy to all of the details.

323
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:27,970
You're right.

324
00:23:28,053 --> 00:23:29,957
I had some pretty selfless friends, huh?

325
00:23:30,040 --> 00:23:31,897
You're not going to defeat me!

326
00:23:31,980 --> 00:23:33,837
This is how it always is.

327
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:36,273
I don't get it until after they're gone.
